      "html": "<div class=\"s-text\"><div class=\"s-stage\">Заключение</div><div class=\"s-num\">В следующий раз</div><h2>Домик из фигур</h2><p class=\"s-big\">Прямоугольник, линия и круг</p></div><div class=\"s-fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 640 300\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"fig-svg\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"640\" height=\"300\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"#fff\"></rect><rect x=\"170\" y=\"140\" width=\"190\" height=\"130\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1b1b1b\" stroke-width=\"5\"></rect><path d=\"M150 140 L265 50 L380 140\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e53935\" stroke-width=\"5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path><line x1=\"150\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"380\" y2=\"140\" stroke=\"#e53935\" stroke-width=\"5\"></line><rect x=\"200\" y=\"175\" width=\"55\" height=\"45\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1e63d6\" stroke-width=\"5\"></rect><rect x=\"285\" y=\"190\" width=\"45\" height=\"80\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#8b5a2b\" stroke-width=\"5\"></rect><circle cx=\"530\" cy=\"75\" r=\"42\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#f2a516\" stroke-width=\"6\"></circle><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"272\" x2=\"600\" y2=\"272\" stroke=\"#43a047\" stroke-width=\"6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></line><g font-size=\"22\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"#ff6a00\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><text x=\"265\" y=\"34\">линии</text><text x=\"530\" y=\"146\">круг</text><text x=\"500\" y=\"215\">прямоугольник</text></g><path d=\"M408 207 L365 207\" stroke=\"#ff6a00\" stroke-width=\"3\"></path></svg></div>"
